{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14912","headline":"秋中野望寄舍弟绶兼令呈上西川尚书舅 · 卢纶","name":"秋中野望寄舍弟绶兼令呈上西川尚书舅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忧来思远望，高处殊非惬。\n夜露湿苍山，秋陂满黄叶。\n人随鴈迢遰，栈与云重叠。\n骨肉暂分离，形神遂疲薾。\n红旌渭阳骑，几日劳登涉。\n蜀道蔼松筠，巴江盛舟檝。\n小生即何限，简诲偏盈箧。\n旧恨尚填膺，新悲复萦睫。\n因求种瓜利，自喜归耕捷。\n井臼赖依邻，儿童亦胜汲。\n尘容不在照，雪鬓那堪镊。\n唯有飡霞心，知夫与天接。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14912.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14912","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}